{"id":"c94730370dfe9091","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence.md","title":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence — dfa nfa language equivalence","display":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence — dfa nfa language equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence","display":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence — dfa nfa language equivalence","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","[[73-df-nfa-notation]]","[[73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation]]","[[73-thm-nfa-determinization]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence","73-theorem-1.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence — dfa nfa language equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11d1c892f16eef2d\" href=\"?note=11d1c892f16eef2d\" title=\"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"222bbfa3171233c2\" href=\"?note=222bbfa3171233c2\" title=\"73-df-nfa-notation\">73-df-nfa-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52ddba8829989be5\" href=\"?note=52ddba8829989be5\" title=\"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation\">73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dca22faafaee72fb\" href=\"?note=dca22faafaee72fb\" title=\"73-thm-nfa-determinization\">73-thm-nfa-determinization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-dfa-nfa-language-equivalence</span><span>73-theorem-1.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两种机器类和其接受语言使用以下直接依赖中固定的同一字母表实例。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DFA}=\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{DFA}=\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NFA}=\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{NFA}=\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 分别使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6d26348026d8f259\" href=\"?note=6d26348026d8f259\" title=\"73-df-dfa-notation\">73-df-dfa-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"222bbfa3171233c2\" href=\"?note=222bbfa3171233c2\" title=\"73-df-nfa-notation\">73-df-nfa-notation</a> 的同一固定字母表实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.1}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;((\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M))\\leftrightarrow(\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{DFA}\\;L=L(M)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.1}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;((\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M))\\leftrightarrow(\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{DFA}\\;L=L(M)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按有限子集状态构造（以及需要时先取空转移闭包）得到保持接受语言的有限自动机；类与语言均在假设所列定义中确定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"11d1c892f16eef2d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-acceptance-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"222bbfa3171233c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation","status":"resolved","id":"52ddba8829989be5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-acceptance-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-nfa-determinization","status":"resolved","id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-nfa-determinization]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"6d26348026d8f259","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DFA}=\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $\\mathrm{NFA}=\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 分别使用 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-nfa-notation]] 的同一固定字母表实例。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-notation","status":"resolved","id":"222bbfa3171233c2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DFA}=\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $\\mathrm{NFA}=\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 分别使用 [[73-df-dfa-notation]]、[[73-df-nfa-notation]] 的同一固定字母表实例。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DFA}=\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NFA}=\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}1.1}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;((\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{NFA}\\;L=L(M))\\leftrightarrow(\\exists M\\in \\mathrm{DFA}\\;L=L(M)))","display":true}],"bytes":1354,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6d26348026d8f259","11d1c892f16eef2d","222bbfa3171233c2","52ddba8829989be5","dca22faafaee72fb","0a6da8c909717780"]}